message.content:
{
  "html": "<div class="product-identity" data-ui-unit="identity">
  <span class="eyebrow">도자기 · 입문</span>
  <h1 class="title">내 손으로 빚는 첫 번째 도자기 잔</h1>
  <div class="price">55,000원</div>
  <div class="metadata">
    <div class="meta-item">
      <img src="assets/icons/Clock.svg" alt=""
           width="20" height="20" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
      <span>90분</span>
    </div>
    <div class="meta-item">
      <img src="assets/icons/Users.svg" alt=""
           width="20" height="20" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
      <span>최대6명</span>
    </div>
    <div class="meta-item">
      <img src="assets/icons/MapPin.svg" alt=""
           width="20" height="20" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
      <span>서울·연남동</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="description">흙을 만지는 감각부터 유약을 고르는 순간까지. 소규모 수업에서 나만의 찻잔을 천천히 완성해 보세요.</p>
</div>",
  "css": ".product-identity[data-ui-unit="identity"] {
  padding-top: 24px;
  padding-bottom: 24px;
}

.product-identity .eyebrow {
  display: inline-block;
  font-size: 14px;
  color: #60606a;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}

.product-identity .title {
  font-size: 22px;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.45;
  color: #202024;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.product-identity .price {
  font-size: 24px;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: #202024;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
}

.product-identity .metadata {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 16px;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
}

.product-identity .meta-item {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 500;
  color: #555560;
}

.product-identity .meta-item img {
  width: 20px;
  height: 20px;
  display: block;
}

.product-identity .description {
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 1.75;
  color: #202024;
  margin-top: 20px;
  margin-bottom: 0;
}

@media (min-width: 701px) {
  .product-identity[data-ui-unit="identity"] {
    padding-top: 0;
  }

  .product-identity .title {
    font-size: 28px;
  }
}"
}
